         </ownedAttribute>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.CDIFCodelistPackage" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#CDIFCodelist-package" xmi:type="uml:Package">
         <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.CDIFCodelistPackage-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#CDIFCodelist-package-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.CDIFCodelistPackage"/>
            <body>Profile for controlled-vocabulary codelists as SKOS ConceptSchemes.</body>
         </ownedComment>
         <name>CDIFCodelist</name>
         <packagedElement xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.XsdDate" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#XsdDate" xmi:type="uml:DataType">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.XsdDate-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#XsdDate-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
               <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.XsdDate"/>
               <body>Primitive data type "date" of the XML Schema data types.

Definition from XML Schema Part 2: Datatypes Second Edition: "The value space of date consists of top-open intervals of exactly one day in length on the timelines of dateTime, beginning on the beginning moment of each day (in each timezone), i.e. '00:00:00', up to but not including '24:00:00' (which is identical with '00:00:00' of the next day). For nontimezoned values, the top-open intervals disjointly cover the nontimezoned timeline, one per day. For timezoned values, the intervals begin at every minute and therefore overlap." For details see https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#date.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>XsdDate</name>
         </packagedElement>
         <packagedElement xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.XsdAnyUri" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#XsdAnyUri" xmi:type="uml:DataType">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.XsdAnyUri-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#XsdAnyUri-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
               <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.XsdAnyUri"/>
               <body>Primitive data type "anyURI" of the XML Schema data types.

Definition from XML Schema Part 2: Datatypes Second Edition: "anyURI" represents a Uniform Resource Identifier Reference (URI). An "anyURI" value can be absolute or relative, and may have an optional fragment identifier (i.e., it may be a URI Reference). This type should be used to specify the intention that the value fulfills the role of a URI as defined by [RFC 2396], as amended by [RFC 2732]. For details see https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#anyURI.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>XsdAnyUri</name>
         </packagedElement>
         <packagedElement xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.Classes" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#Classes-package" xmi:type="uml:Package">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.Classes-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#Classes-package-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
               <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.Classes"/>
               <body>Target classes of the CDIF profile.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Classes</name>
            <packagedElement xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme" xmi:type="uml:Class">
               <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme"/>
                  <body>A SKOS Concept Scheme - an aggregation of one or more SKOS Concepts, forming a controlled vocabulary or codelist. CDIF requires a resolvable @id, schema:identifier, schema:dateModified, and skos:hasTopConcept, plus either schema:license or schema:conditionsOfAccess.</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <name>ConceptScheme</name>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-prefLabel" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-prefLabel" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-prefLabel-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-prefLabel-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-prefLabel"/>
                     <body>skos:prefLabel - the preferred lexical label for the concept scheme. Required.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-prefLabel-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-prefLabel-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>1</value>
                  </lowerValue>
                  <upperValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-prefLabel-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-prefLabel-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                     <value>*</value>
                  </upperValue>
                  <name>prefLabel</name>
                  <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
               </ownedAttribute>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-altLabel" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-altLabel" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-altLabel-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-altLabel-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-altLabel"/>
                     <body>skos:altLabel - alternative lexical labels (acronyms, abbreviations, variants).</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-altLabel-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-altLabel-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>0</value>
                  </lowerValue>
                  <upperValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-altLabel-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-altLabel-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                     <value>*</value>
                  </upperValue>
                  <name>altLabel</name>
                  <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
               </ownedAttribute>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel"/>
                     <body>skos:hiddenLabel - labels accessible to free-text search but not displayed.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>0</value>
                  </lowerValue>
                  <upperValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-hiddenLabel-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                     <value>*</value>
                  </upperValue>
                  <name>hiddenLabel</name>
                  <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
               </ownedAttribute>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-definition" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-definition" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-definition-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-definition-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-definition"/>
                     <body>skos:definition - formal explanation of the meaning or purpose of this concept scheme. DDI-CDI cdi:purpose carries the same semantics.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-definition-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-definition-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>0</value>
                  </lowerValue>
                  <upperValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-definition-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-definition-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                     <value>*</value>
                  </upperValue>
                  <name>definition</name>
                  <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
               </ownedAttribute>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-notation" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-notation" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-notation-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-notation-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-notation"/>
                     <body>skos:notation - classification code or notation for this concept scheme.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-notation-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-notation-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>0</value>
                  </lowerValue>
                  <upperValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-notation-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-notation-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                     <value>*</value>
                  </upperValue>
                  <name>notation</name>
                  <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
               </ownedAttribute>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-note" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-note" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-note-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-note-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-note"/>
                     <body>skos:note - general note about the concept scheme.</body>
                  </ownedComment>
                  <lowerValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-note-lowerValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-note-lowerValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger">
                     <value>0</value>
                  </lowerValue>
                  <upperValue xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-note-upperValue" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-note-upperValue" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
                     <value>*</value>
                  </upperValue>
                  <name>note</name>
                  <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="http://www.eclipse.org/uml2/5.0.0/UML/PrimitiveTypes.xmi#String"/>
               </ownedAttribute>
               <ownedAttribute xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-scopeNote" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-scopeNote" xmi:type="uml:Property">
                  <ownedComment xmi:id="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-scopeNote-ownedComment" xmi:uuid="https://w3id.org/cdif/codelist/1.0/xmi/#ConceptScheme-scopeNote-ownedComment" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
                     <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCodelist.ConceptScheme-scopeNote"/>
